./docs/articles/new-expensify/connections/netsuite/Configure-Netsuite.md:126:Any workspace admin can export reports to NetSuite. For auto-export, Concierge will export on behalf of the preferred exporter. The preferred exporter will also be notified of any expense reports that fail to export to NetSuite due to an error.
