./docs/articles/new-expensify/connections/sage-intacct/Configure-Sage-Intacct.md:27:Once permissions are set, you can map categories to specific items, which will then export to Sage Intacct. When an expense is marked as Billable in Expensify, users must select the correct billable Category (Item), or there will be an error during export.
